# The production deploy also answers on its netlify.app alias, which is fully
# crawlable and, because the Plausible domain is baked into the script, reports
# as production traffic. Send the alias to the real host. Branch deploys and
# deploy previews have their own hostnames and are untouched. The legacy
# Squarespace redirects live in nuxt.config routeRules; Nitro merges this file
# with those at build time.
https://kwsymphony.netlify.app/* https://www.kwsymphony.com/:splat 301!
